   "en": "The stage is the Edo period. The shogunate imposed on the death prisoners a \"gozen match\" in the fighting arena. If you win as many times as the number of chains you have on your arm, you will be granted a special pardon from your boss. A courier who raped and murdered men and women of all ages, a sumo wrestler who killed 82 people, and a man who committed the mortal crime of \"castle destruction.\" The \"Most Evil\" decisive battle begins! Who is the best foreigner! ?"
